# Reverse Proxy in C++ (Threadpool + Epoll + Load Balancer)

A high-performance reverse proxy implemented fully in C++17 using epoll, a custom thread-pool, HTTP parser, LRU cache, load balancer, and backend handler.

## Features
- Round-robin load balancing
- Thread pool for concurrency
- epoll-based non-blocking IO
- Easy configuration (`configs/backends.conf`)
- Modular architecture

